{"title": "Mind Flayer Form (Condition)", "pageid": 27648, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Form_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind Flayer Form Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Mind Flayer Form</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has embraced ceremorphosis and become a mind flayer. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MINDFLAYERFORM</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CMINDFLAYERFORM%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CMINDFLAYERFORM%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/40px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/60px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/80px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp/40px-Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Ability_Drain_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Drain\" title=\"Ability Drain\">Ability Drain</a></span></dt><dd>Once per turn, when you make an <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>, the attack reduces that target's corresponding Ability by 1. The reduced ability score cannot be decreased lower than 1.</dd></dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charm\" title=\"Charm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/40px-Charm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/60px-Charm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/80px-Charm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/40px-Charm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Charm\" title=\"Charm\">Charm</a></span></dt><dd>Channel the dark allure of the tadpole to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\">Charm</a> an enemy that attacks you, preventing them from attacking you until their next turn.</dd></dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cull_the_Weak\" title=\"Cull the Weak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/40px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/60px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/80px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cull the Weak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/40px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cull_the_Weak\" title=\"Cull the Weak\">Cull the Weak</a></span></dt><dd>When you bring a creature down to fewer hit points than your number of evolved illithid powers, it dies and all nearby creatures take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1~4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage.</dd></dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Favourable_Beginnings\" title=\"Favourable Beginnings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/40px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/60px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/80px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Favourable Beginnings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/40px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Favourable_Beginnings\" title=\"Favourable Beginnings\">Favourable Beginnings</a></span></dt><dd>The first <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/34px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/45px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Check</a> you make against any target gains a bonus equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a>.</dd></dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms\" title=\"Luck of the Far Realms\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/40px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/60px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/80px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Luck of the Far Realms\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/40px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms\" title=\"Luck of the Far Realms\">Luck of the Far Realms</a></span></dt><dd>Once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>, you can change a successful <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> against a foe into a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a>.</dd></dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Permanent_Mind_Sanctuary\" title=\"Permanent Mind Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/40px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/60px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/80px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Permanent Mind Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/40px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Permanent_Mind_Sanctuary\" title=\"Permanent Mind Sanctuary\">Permanent Mind Sanctuary</a></span></dt><dd>You can use actions and bonus actions interchangeably.</dd></dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Backlash_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Psionic Backlash (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp/40px-Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp/60px-Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp/80px-Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Backlash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp/40px-Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Backlash_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Psionic Backlash (passive feature)\">Psionic Backlash</a></span></dt><dd>When a nearby enemy casts a spell, you use your <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction_(Resource)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction (Resource)\">reaction</a> to deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage for every level of that spell.</dd></dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Dominance_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Psionic Dominance (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/40px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/60px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/80px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Dominance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/40px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Dominance_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Psionic Dominance (passive feature)\">Psionic Dominance</a></span></dt><dd>When an enemy within 18 m (60 ft) targets you with a spell of a Level that is lower than or equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a>, you can use your reaction to nullify the spell.</dd></dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Permanent_Mind_Sanctuary\">Condition: Permanent Mind Sanctuary</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Permanent_Mind_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Permanent Mind Sanctuary (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Permanent Mind Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Permanent_Mind_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Permanent Mind Sanctuary (Condition)\">Permanent Mind Sanctuary</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>While in combat, Mind Flayers can use actions and bonus actions interchangeably.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Mind_Flayer_Form\">Sources of Mind Flayer Form</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ceremorphosis\" title=\"Ceremorphosis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp/30px-Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp/45px-Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp/60px-Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ceremorphosis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp/30px-Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ceremorphosis\" title=\"Ceremorphosis\">Ceremorphosis</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Mind_Flayer_Form\">Creatures with Mind Flayer Form</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png/30px-Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png/45px-Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png/60px-Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Full-illithid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png/30px-Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">Full-illithid</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/30px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/45px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/60px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orpheus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/30px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\">Orpheus</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714222718\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.106 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4137/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 75435/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13817/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.054/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1388174/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   90.531      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   90.531      1 -total\n 37.99%   34.397      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 26.88%   24.332      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 23.15%   20.961     13 Template:Icon_link\n 22.07%   19.976     13 Template:Icon_text\n 18.05%   16.341     36 Template:Trim\n 14.55%   13.173      8 Template:Passive/format\n 13.56%   12.272 